<body>
  <main class="page">
    <p>Prep King is $20 a month for four Sundays.</p>
    <p>You send a text or a topic. You get sixty minutes of prep you can hear and read, on a private link. Not a public show, not a file in your inbox.</p>
    <p>Use that month’s packs for your own preaching. We keep the audio and the coverage. We do not keep the sermon you write. Your name never goes on a pack.</p>
    <p>This is the week before you preach. Sermon Steward is the page after.</p>
    <p>Write Chris at <a href="mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org">chris@sovgracekc.org</a> if you want in.</p>
  </main>
